nicity of multiplication by nonnegative elements on\nthe right, namely `a₁ * b < a₂ * b → a₁ < a₂` if `0 ≤ b`.\n\nYou should usually not use this very granular typeclass directly, but rather a typeclass like\n`LinearOrderedSemiring`. -/\n@[mk_iff] class MulPosReflectLT : Prop extends ContravariantClass α≥0 α (fun x y => y * x) (· < ·)","start":144,"end":149},"axioms":[]}